# Service Booking Application — AI Coding Rules

## 1. Project Identity

You are working on a full-stack application named **Service Booking Application**.

The application is designed for clinics or service centers. Customers can register, log in, browse services, view available appointment slots, book appointments, reschedule appointments, cancel appointments, and view booking history.

Administrators can manage services, providers, availability slots, and customer bookings.

Your responsibility is to develop this application according to the approved project documentation.

